WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,670
brother

2
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:02,320
I heard you bullied my brother

3
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,440
He is your little brother

4
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:04,360
Since he is your little brother

5
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:05,720
Then you should restrain them even more

6
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:07,200
Don't let them do something wrong

7
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,360
What does it have to do with us singing and dancing up there?

8
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:10,360
I want you to mind your own business

9
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:11,440
He ran out and beat us up.

10
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:12,840
I have advised you

11
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:14,840
But you don’t listen and want to beat me

12
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:16,720
It should be you who hit me

13
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:17,880
It’s just that there are so many of you

14
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:21,480
You can't beat me alone, brother, don't worry about that.

15
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:22,720
We are all civilized people

16
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:23,680
It’s a civilized society now

17
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:25,480
If you have something to say, say it well. Look like this.

18
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:26,840
You beat my little brother too

19
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:28,000
My younger brother is more generous

20
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,120
I didn’t even hug my uncle

21
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:31,080
Otherwise, you should apologize to us.

22
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:32,040
so funny

23
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:33,800
It's obvious that you did something wrong

24
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:35,600
I just missed some results

25
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:37,280
You actually have the nerve to ask me to apologize

26
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:38,920
How can there be such a reason in the world?

27
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:40,320
People who have done wrong do not need to apologize

28
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:42,200
It just means that the person who did something wrong should apologize instead

29
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:46,390
What kind of bullshit is this?

30
00:00:46,390 --> 00:00:49,280
What are you doing with this thing? Come over here

31
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:50,960
My seventy-kilogram bili stick is actually like this

32
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:52,200
It crushed him so easily

33
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,880
Who asked you to disturb my elder brother's sleep?

34
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:55,320
You and your wife are sleeping here

35
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:57,600
Who can fall asleep when you are banging and dancing there every day?

36
00:00:57,600 --> 00:00:59,200
You still have the nerve to come over and complain to me.

37
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,120
Are you looking for death?
